{"seq":1,"slug":"capacity-planning","title":"容量规划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/queueing-theory/practice/capacity-planning","wordCount":1431,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"容量规划\">容量规划</h1><p>「我们要买几台服务器？利用率定在多少？」——这是排队论在工程组织里被问得最多的问题，也是它最直接创造价值的地方。容量规划不是拍脑袋乘个安全系数，而是把 <a href=\"../models/mm1-queue\">M/M/1 队列</a> 的延迟爆炸曲线、<a href=\"../models/mmc-multiserver\">M/M/c 多服务台</a> 的 Erlang C、<a href=\"../networks/bottleneck-analysis\">瓶颈分析</a> 的吞吐上界，组装成一套可操作的供给决策方法。核心矛盾永远是同一个：利用率压太低浪费钱，压太高一遇流量毛刺就雪崩。这一篇教你在这条钢丝上找平衡点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>容量规划要同时满足三个约束，缺一不可：<strong>稳定性</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho&lt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，否则队列无限增长）、<strong>延迟 SLA</strong>（如 P99 &lt; 200ms）、<strong>成本</strong>（服务台越多越贵）。它们把可行的服务台数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 卡在一个区间里。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  IN[&quot;输入: 预测到达率 λ&lt;br/&gt;单台服务率 μ&lt;br/&gt;SLA 目标&quot;] --&gt; STAB{&quot;c &gt; λ/μ?&lt;br/&gt;稳定门槛&quot;}&#10;  STAB --&gt;|否| MORE[&quot;增加 c&quot;]&#10;  STAB --&gt;|是| SLA{&quot;Erlang C 算出的&lt;br/&gt;Wq 满足 SLA?&quot;}&#10;  SLA --&gt;|否| MORE&#10;  SLA --&gt;|是| COST[&quot;在满足 SLA 的最小 c&lt;br/&gt;基础上加冗余 headroom&quot;]&#10;  COST --&gt; OUT[&quot;最终容量 c + 冗余&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  IN[\"输入: 预测到达率 λ&lt;br/&gt;单台服务率 μ&lt;br/&gt;SLA 目标\"] --&gt; STAB{\"c &gt; λ/μ?&lt;br/&gt;稳定门槛\"}\n  STAB --&gt;|否| MORE[\"增加 c\"]\n  STAB --&gt;|是| SLA{\"Erlang C 算出的&lt;br/&gt;Wq 满足 SLA?\"}\n  SLA --&gt;|否| MORE\n  SLA --&gt;|是| COST[\"在满足 SLA 的最小 c&lt;br/&gt;基础上加冗余 headroom\"]\n  COST --&gt; OUT[\"最终容量 c + 冗余\"]</pre><p>关键认知：稳定门槛 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c&gt;\\lambda/\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 只是底线，真正决定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 的往往是 SLA——满足延迟目标所需的服务台，通常远多于仅仅稳定所需的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"利用率目标-headroom-从哪来\">利用率目标：headroom 从哪来</h2><p>为什么不能把服务器跑到 95%？<a href=\"../models/mm1-queue\">M/M/1 队列</a> 已给出答案：延迟放大因子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/(1-\\rho)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 在高利用率下陡峭。容量规划把这条曲线翻译成具体的利用率目标：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>系统类型</th>\n<th>推荐峰值利用率</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单台、延迟敏感（M/M/1）</td>\n<td>50–70%</td>\n<td>放大因子陡，毛刺即雪崩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多台、共享队列（M/M/c，c 大）</td>\n<td>75–85%</td>\n<td>统计复用平滑了波动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>批处理、吞吐优先</td>\n<td>90–95%</td>\n<td>不在乎延迟，要榨干资源</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个反复出现的工程结论：<strong>服务台越多，可以安全地跑得越满</strong>。这是 <a href=\"../models/mmc-multiserver\">M/M/c 多服务台</a> 的统计复用红利——单台跑 70% 已危险，但 50 台的池子跑 85% 仍然平稳，因为大数定律把波动磨平了。所以「合并资源池」本身就是一种提升可用利用率、省钱的手段。预留的那部分不跑满的容量就是 <strong>headroom</strong>，专门用来吸收流量毛刺与单点故障。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用-erlang-c-求最小服务台数\">用 Erlang C 求最小服务台数</h2><p>给定到达率与 SLA，求满足延迟目标的最小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，标准做法是对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 从稳定门槛起逐个试，用 Erlang C 算等待，直到达标。设一个客服系统高峰 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda=10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 通话/分钟、平均通话 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/\\mu=3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu=1/3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/3</span></span></span></span></span>），SLA 要求「平均等待 &lt; 30 秒」。提供负载 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a=\\lambda/\\mu=30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span> Erlang，稳定需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c&gt;30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>31</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c=31</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">31</span></span></span></span></span>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.97</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho=0.97</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.97</span></span></span></span></span>，等待极长，远超 SLA。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>34</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c=34</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">34</span></span></span></span></span>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.88</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho=0.88</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.88</span></span></span></span></span>，平均等待约 1 分钟，仍不达标。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c=36</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">36</span></span></span></span></span>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.83</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho=0.83</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.83</span></span></span></span></span>，平均等待约 25 秒，<strong>首次达标</strong>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>38</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c=38</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">38</span></span></span></span></span>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.79</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho=0.79</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.79</span></span></span></span></span>，等待降到约 12 秒，留出了 headroom。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c=36</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">36</span></span></span></span></span> 是满足 SLA 的最小配置，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>38</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c=38</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">38</span></span></span></span></span> 是加了冗余的稳健配置。注意从稳定门槛 31 到达标的 36，多用了 5 个坐席——<strong>仅仅稳定远不够，SLA 才是真正的成本驱动</strong>。这个「逐个试 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 找最小达标值」的过程，本质是一个整数规划，可与<a href=\"../../optimization-theory/constrained-optimization/linear-programming\">最优化理论</a>的方法对接做成本最优。</p>\n<h2 id=\"冗余设计-n-1-与-n-2\">冗余设计：N+1 与 N+2</h2><p>headroom 不只为流量毛刺，还为<strong>故障</strong>。如果按「刚好满足峰值」配置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 台，那么任何一台宕机，剩下的就过载、SLA 立刻击穿。冗余设计的标准做法：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  N[&quot;N 台&lt;br/&gt;刚好满足峰值&quot;] --&gt; N1[&quot;N+1&lt;br/&gt;容忍 1 台故障&quot;]&#10;  N1 --&gt; N2[&quot;N+2&lt;br/&gt;容忍 2 台故障&lt;br/&gt;或滚动升级时仍达标&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n  N[\"N 台&lt;br/&gt;刚好满足峰值\"] --&gt; N1[\"N+1&lt;br/&gt;容忍 1 台故障\"]\n  N1 --&gt; N2[\"N+2&lt;br/&gt;容忍 2 台故障&lt;br/&gt;或滚动升级时仍达标\"]</pre><p><strong>N+1</strong> 容忍单点故障，是生产系统的底线；<strong>N+2</strong> 额外容忍「故障期间又要滚动发布」或「故障恰逢流量高峰」，是关键系统的常规。注意冗余不是简单加一台——要保证少一台后剩余容量用 Erlang C 重算仍满足 SLA。上例 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c=36</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">36</span></span></span></span></span> 达标的系统，若要 N+1，得配 37–38 台，使任意一台宕机后剩下的仍能撑住 SLA。</p>\n<h2 id=\"预测-毛刺与自动伸缩\">预测、毛刺与自动伸缩</h2><p>容量规划的输入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 是<strong>预测值</strong>，预测误差直接吃掉 headroom。实践中三个要点：其一，按<strong>峰值而非均值</strong>规划——按日均流量配容量，到了高峰必崩，要用 P95/P99 时段的到达率；其二，留<strong>毛刺缓冲</strong>，真实流量的瞬时峰值常是均值的数倍，到达过程的突发性（变异系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_a&gt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，见 <a href=\"../foundations/queueing-elements\">排队系统要素</a>）会让排队比泊松假设更糟；其三，云时代的<strong>自动伸缩</strong>把静态容量规划变成动态的——但排队论仍是它的内核：伸缩阈值（如「CPU &gt; 70% 扩容」）正是利用率目标，扩容步长与冷却时间要保证扩容速度跟得上 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 上升速度，否则在伸缩追上之前系统已经雪崩。能用排队论估出「从触发扩容到新实例就绪」这段时间内队列会涨多少，是配置自动伸缩的关键。更细的软件系统视角见 <a href=\"performance-engineering-queueing\">性能工程应用</a>；当负载模式复杂到解析模型不可信时，转 <a href=\"queueing-simulation\">排队仿真</a> 做容量验证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>容量规划在稳定性、延迟 SLA、成本三约束间求服务台数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>；SLA 通常比稳定门槛更吃容量。</li>\n<li>利用率目标来自延迟放大因子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/(1-\\rho)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：单台 50–70%、大池 75–85%、批处理 90–95%。</li>\n<li>服务台越多越能跑满（统计复用红利），合并资源池本身就是省钱手段；不跑满的部分是 headroom。</li>\n<li>用 Erlang C 逐个试 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 求最小达标配置，再叠加 N+1/N+2 冗余；输入按峰值预测、留毛刺缓冲。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章下一篇：<a href=\"performance-engineering-queueing\">性能工程应用</a> —— 软件系统的尾延迟与 USL。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../models/mmc-multiserver\">M/M/c 多服务台</a> —— Erlang C 求服务台数的模型基础。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../networks/bottleneck-analysis\">瓶颈分析</a> —— 多节点系统该给谁扩容。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../optimization-theory/constrained-optimization/linear-programming\">线性规划</a> —— 成本约束下的容量最优化。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"容量规划","id":"容量规划"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"利用率目标：headroom 从哪来","id":"利用率目标-headroom-从哪来"},{"level":2,"text":"用 Erlang C 求最小服务台数","id":"用-erlang-c-求最小服务台数"},{"level":2,"text":"冗余设计：N+1 与 N+2","id":"冗余设计-n-1-与-n-2"},{"level":2,"text":"预测、毛刺与自动伸缩","id":"预测-毛刺与自动伸缩"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"瓶颈分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/queueing-theory/networks/bottleneck-analysis"},"next":{"title":"性能工程应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/queueing-theory/practice/performance-engineering-queueing"}}